stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested

    Requested --> Pending: Valid request
    Requested --> Rejected: Invalid request

    Pending --> Approved: Authorized approver
    Pending --> Rejected: Approval denied
    Pending --> Expired: Deadline exceeded
    Pending --> Rejected: Approval decision recorded

    Approved --> Revalidating: Execution requested

    Revalidating --> Authorized: Policy and scope valid
    Revalidating --> Rejected: Policy or scope invalid
    Revalidating --> Expired: Approval expired

    Authorized --> Executed: Protected action succeeds
    Authorized --> Failed: Execution fails

    state "SQLite state + lifecycle event transaction" as Durable
    Pending --> Durable: Created / decided / expired
    Authorized --> Durable: One-time consumption

    Executed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]
